        "zh-CN": "Generate today's Open Orbit morning briefing. I have ~10 connectors connected (GitHub, Linear, Notion, Calendar, 飞书, Sentry, Vercel, Slack, Gmail, Drive). Pull yesterday's activity from each and render the editorial bento dashboard."
